 style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">- 아&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;래 -</font></span></p>\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\"></font></span>&nbsp;</p>\n            <p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">1. 분반과목 : </font></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">공학설계입문, 대학수학1, 대학수학2, 일반물리학1, 일반물리학2,&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;일반화학1,</font></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\"> </font></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">전공컴퓨터기초,</font></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;확률및통계, 회로이론1, 전자회로2</font></span></p>\n            <p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;☞</font></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\"> 수강반 확인 : 원스톱서비스 - 수업 - 계절학기 수강신청내역 조회</font></span></p>\n            <p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: mediumblue; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">☞</font></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: mediumblue; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">분반기준 : 수강신청 선착순(분반은